<title>USA: Consep aims for Oct. to offer two mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Consep aims for Oct. to offer two mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BEND, Ore. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consep Inc said Friday it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to offer two million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to sell 1,455,563 shares and a non-employee shareholder intends to sell 544,437 shares. The company said it expects the offering to occur in late October.</p>
<p>Consep develops, manufactures and markets environmentally safe pest control products.</p>
</text>
